title: With saving while typing on, a guest types in a shared file while another program appends to it on the host's disk: what was typed and the appended line both end in the file, with no Ctrl+S
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^line 01\nline 02typed-by-beto\.x{10}\nline 03\n
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: written by another program\n$

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 11500
touch notes.txt written by another program
wait 3500
goto notes.txt
wait 1500
mark host-after-the-other-program
wait 9000
mark host-after-the-guest-typed
wait 3000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
goto notes.txt
wait 1000
edit notes.txt 2 1
key end
type typed-by-beto.
wait 1200
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 280
type x
wait 6000
mark after-typing
wait 2500
quit
wait 1500
